@startuml
title AgriDrone v3 - Paid MAP/COMBO target flow (2026-11-10)
start
:Select MAP or COMBO;
if (First survey / new Farm?) then (yes)
  :Admin approves onboarding;
  :Provision correct Tenant/Farm/Owner invitation;
else (Follow-up)
  :Reuse Tenant/Farm and delivered Baseline version;
endif
:Create paid Order;
:Snapshot service / unit price / shared deposit / policy versions;
:Confirm appointment and pay deposit;
:Check assignment, drone, preflight, safety and authorization;
:Capture imagery and GNSS;
:Upload / FastAPI processing / pending candidates;
while (Capture quality inadequate?) is (yes)
  :Approved quality Re-flight in same Order;
  :No extra deposit or service charge;
  :Recheck operational safety and capture again;
  :Retain original attempts and evidence;
endwhile (no)
:Manager reviews boundary, matches and billable poles;
if (First survey?) then (yes)
  :Approve internal Baseline and initial profile identities;
else (Follow-up)
  :Append survey snapshot and dated observations;
  :Keep pinned Baseline unchanged;
endif
if (COMBO?) then (yes)
  :Review suspected diseases, zones and cited guidance;
else (MAP)
  :Disease observation = NotAssessed;
  :Preserve prior disease history;
endif
:Freeze approved result and finalize count x snapshotted rate;
if (Amount due > 0?) then (yes)
  :Owner pays remaining online balance;
else (no)
  :Reserve any refundable overpayment;
endif
:Atomic publication + unlock + durable notice;
:Claim window + one original service value + audit/Outbox;
:Owner views released versions and history;
if (Evidenced claim before deadline?) then (yes)
  :Manager verification;
  :Admin proposal + Owner exact acceptance;
  :Reserve capped refund and record bank proof;
  :Withdraw / review replacement when required;
endif
:Monthly service revenue / cash / Excel reconciliation;
stop
@enduml
